 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "With Barinov out of the way, Elena is running his kitchen at Claude Monet her own way. She speaks politely, calls the cooks by their full names, and nobody shouts. The cooks don't quite know what to make of it. It's in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Фёдор, приготовьте две порции креветок.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Шеф должен кричать на поваров!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Арсений, вы заслуживаете достойного обращения.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Но на кухне нужна строгая дисциплина.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "У вас самое чистое рабочее место.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "Где горячее блюдо для третьего столика?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "Гости ждут уже сорок минут!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Саша, спокойно, давайте глубоко дышать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Это блюдо готовится больше часа.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "Они грозятся уйти без оплаты.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Попросите гостей подождать ещё немного.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Новый заказ: куропатка и грибы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Мы всё сделаем вовремя, шеф!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Slowly now. Elena asks rather than shouts, even when the guests start to complain.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Фёдор, приготовьте две порции креветок.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Fyodor, prepare two portions of shrimp.' Listen to how polite she sounds using ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "приготовьте",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " to tell the cook to prepare the food.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Шеф должен кричать на поваров!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'A chef should shout at cooks!' Everyone usually expects a chef to ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "кричать",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " or shout loudly at the cooks.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Арсений, вы заслуживаете достойного обращения.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Arseny, you deserve respectful treatment.' Notice how she respectfully tells him that he ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "заслуживаете",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " or deserves to be treated well.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Но на кухне нужна строгая дисциплина.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But strict discipline is needed in the kitchen.' He still firmly believes that very ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "строгая",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " and rigid discipline is absolutely necessary.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "У вас самое чистое рабочее место.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You have the cleanest workstation.' She kindly compliments his station for being the most ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "чистое",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " or clean area in the whole place.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "Где горячее блюдо для третьего столика?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Where is the hot dish for table three?' Frantically looking for the missing food, she needs a ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "горячее",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " hot dish to serve to her waiting table.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "Гости ждут уже сорок минут!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The guests have been waiting forty minutes already!' Her frustrated customers have been sitting there for ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "сорок",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " minutes while waiting for their food.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Саша, спокойно, давайте глубоко дышать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Sasha, calmly, let us breathe deeply.' In an effort to calm the waitress down, she suggests to ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "дышать",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " deeply and just relax a bit.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Это блюдо готовится больше часа.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This dish takes over an hour to cook.' Quietly explaining the delay, she notes the food ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "готовится",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " or cooks for more than an hour.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "Они грозятся уйти без оплаты.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'They threaten to leave without paying.' Furious customers are so upset that they ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "sasha",
   "t": "грозятся",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " to simply walk out without paying.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Попросите гостей подождать ещё немного.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Ask the guests to wait a little longer.' Instead of panicking, the boss asks the waitress to have them ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "подождать",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " a little longer.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Новый заказ: куропатка и грибы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'New order: partridge and mushrooms.' Moving on to the next task, a ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Новый",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " fresh order comes in for the chefs to prepare.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Мы всё сделаем вовремя, шеф!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We will make everything on time, chef!' Eager to please the boss, the cook promises they ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "сделаем",
   "gap": 0.25
